ge text and page images where the structured tables were flagged unreliable.\",\"checks_completed\":[\"Read parser-quality guidance and used page text/images in place of structured table markdown\",\"Read full_text.md in full and recomputed the sample funnel, manual coding counts, agreement tables, Table 6 totals, project counts, Table 7 shares and Table 8 shares\",\"Checked text values against Figure 1-4 labels in the page images\",\"Tested adding-up identities: sample funnel, Table 2 articles, Tables 3/4 margins, Table 6 date precision, Table 8 any/no-mention split; confirmed the Table 8 type rows are non-exhaustive as the paper states\",\"Compared percentage versus percentage-point wording (35% to 44% rise of about 9 percentage points)\",\"Checked Table 5 NVDB values, elapsed times and the weekday\",\"Compared Table 8 category shares with the Figure 2 word shares for bound consistency (union at least the maximum word, at most the sum)\"],\"missing_checks\":[],\"evidence_limitations\":[\"numbers_in_text.json was not inspected beyond confirming it exists; the coverage pass was done on full_text.md and page images\",\"The numerical wrapper script was not run; recomputations are hand calculations\",\"Figure 1-4 values were read from page text and images; Figure 3 points are not labelled so only approximate levels were read\",\"Pilot/rounds 2-4 overlap and county weights behind the Norway-wide 38.1% are not documented in the paper\",\"External literature statistics were not verified\"]},\"coverage\":[{\"item_id\":\"assigned_remit\",\"source_object_ids\":[],\"claim\":null,\"check_performed\":\"Full read of full_text.md and recomputation of all central counts, shares, identities, percentage versus percentage-point statements and elapsed times; figures compared with page images.\",\"status\":\"linked_finding\",\"reason\":\"Two verified defects (NUM-001, NUM-002) and one cannot_verify finding (NUM-003); all other checked quantities reconcile. Scope was exhaustive for the 